        },
        {
          "text": "Nami qara beesisa suni ira keeyate namicha gudda Nehemia ilma Hekalia jed'ani, isa gula Zedekiyati keeyate. Duuba eege jari kuni d'ibileeni keeyate:",
          "type": "text",
