              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 15.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja worri gosa d'ibi mid'aanifi waan d'ibile guyya Sabatotifi guyya jila deebie nu gurgure, nu iraa imbinnu. Ganna torbeeso ch'ufa lafa qotu lakimne, nama gati teenna qabule ch'ufa yaala baanafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.11+EXO.30.12+EXO.30.13+EXO.30.14+EXO.30.15+EXO.30.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 30.11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna ch'ufa nuuni ch'ufti qarsi huji Mana Waaqati baasu malani baamna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti nu huji Mana Waaqati baamnu tana: Qit'a Waaqaa baasani, mid'aani guyya ch'ufa Waaqaa baasani, hori gubani Waaqaa baasani, waan guyya Sabatotifi guyya jila baatitifi jila d'ibile baasanifi ammalle waan qulqullo d'ibi baasanifi, sorio daba Israelitini baasanifi waan d'ibi Mana Waaqati baasani ch'ufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
